<title>USA: BASEBALL-AMERICAN LEAGUE GOLD GLOVE AWARD WINNERS. [CORRECTED 22:15 GMT]</title>
<headline>BASEBALL-AMERICAN LEAGUE GOLD GLOVE AWARD WINNERS. [CORRECTED 22:15 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 1996 American League Gold</p>
<p>Glove Award winners for fielding excellence announced on</p>
<p>Tuesday:</p>
<p>1B - J.T. Snow, California Angels</p>
<p>2B - Roberto Alomar, Baltimore Orioles (Corrects from Toronto Blue Jays)</p>
<p>3B - Robin Ventura, Chicago White Sox</p>
<p>SS - Omar Vizquel, Cleveland Indians</p>
<p>OF - Ken Griffey, Seattle Mariners</p>
<p>OF - Kenny Lofton, Cleveland Indians</p>
<p>OF - Jay Buhner, Seattle Mariners</p>
<p>C - Ivan Rodriguez, Texas Rangers</p>
<p>P - Mike Mussina, Baltimore Orioles</p>
</text>
